      "headline": "I make organizations work. Turnarounds, leadership, and operational excellence at scale.",
      "about": "I get called when things are broken and stakes are high. If your org is underperforming and you can’t figure out why, or you know why but nothing you’ve tried has worked, that’s my specialty.\n\nFor 25+ years, I’ve walked into organizations — small and massive — to figure out why they’re stuck and make them move. The diagnosis is rarely just technical. It’s culture. It’s leadership. It’s structure, process, relationships, or some combination of them all.\nI find the real problems, build the plan, coach the leaders, and drive the turnaround.\n\nYes, I’m a technologist. But technology is just one lever. The organizations I lead deliver outsized results because I fix the whole machine.",
